```

Exact AC7 diagnostic shape:

```text
workspace selector 'default' for session 'abc' is unanchored; refused to select a store from candidates: C:/repo/.ticket, C:/repo/.worktrees/a/.ticket, C:/repo/.worktrees/b/.ticket
```

The candidate list contains the main checkout’s store path plus each canonical registry worktree’s corresponding `store_dir`; it is diagnostic-only.

