cargo build -p session-workspace-resolver
```
If the crate fails to compile because a session-api type or field name differs from what is stated above, READ the real definition and adapt — the API shapes above are a design, and session-api's actual signatures win. Report any such deviation explicitly.

You may retry a failing test ONCE after diagnosing it. If it still fails, stop and report the blocker rather than continuing to iterate.

